# Copy to `apps/studio/.env`, then replace the dummy values with real ones.
# The dummies below are shaped correctly, so a fresh clone builds as-is.
#
# The studio has NO env schema — every read is a raw `process.env.X` with a
# `?? "fallback"`. That fallback only fires when the key is ABSENT: `KEY=`
# yields "", which is not nullish and sails straight through. Delete a line
# rather than blanking it.
#
# Loaded by `dotenv/config` from this directory's `.env` (sanity.cli.ts:3).
# Vite also picks up `.env`/`.env.local` here for `SANITY_STUDIO_*` at build.

# ─── Sanity ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# From sanity.io/manage. Project ID accepts only [a-z0-9-] — no underscores.
# Use the same project ID and dataset as apps/web's NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_* pair.
SANITY_STUDIO_PROJECT_ID=abcd1234
SANITY_STUDIO_DATASET=production

# Optional — studio title in the UI.
SANITY_STUDIO_TITLE="Turbo Studio"

# Where the Presentation tool points its preview iframe: your running web app.
SANITY_STUDIO_PRESENTATION_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Optional — dataset API version (utils/constants.ts, defaults to 2025-05-08).
SANITY_STUDIO_API_VERSION=2025-05-08

# Optional — `<hostname>.sanity.studio` target for `pnpm deploy`. Unset locally.
# In CI it is combined with HOST_NAME (the branch) to give per-branch studios.
# SANITY_STUDIO_PRODUCTION_HOSTNAME=
# HOST_NAME=

# Write token from sanity.io/manage → API → Tokens.
# No studio code reads this today — the seed/cleanup scripts that did were
# removed during the BigCommerce conversion. It is listed because apps/web's
# env schema requires it; keep this value identical to SANITY_API_WRITE_TOKEN
# in apps/web/.env.local. Not needed for dev, build or deploy.
SANITY_API_WRITE_TOKEN=dummy-sanity-write-token

# ─── Shopify Admin API ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used only by `pnpm seed:shopify` (scripts/seed-shopify). Not needed to build.
# Token comes from a custom app in the Shopify admin, not the storefront token.
SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=dummy-store.myshopify.com
SHOPIFY_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN=shpat_00000000000000000000000000000000

# ─── Not listed on purpose ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NODE_ENV is read in utils/helper.ts but is set by the toolchain — leave it out.
